    "__Лимиты__: нет\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## Подробности:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $$r_t = \\log\\Big(0.5 + \\sum_{j} (\\vec{x}_{out} - \\vec{x}_{in})_j\\Big)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- $$f^{prod}_1(\\vec{x}) = (0, 2 \\vec{x}_1)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- $$f^{prod}_2(\\vec{x}) = ( 2 \\vec{x}_1, 0)$$\n",
    "\n",
